log 15. The Zhentil Keep outpost (6:28): escape fast
# Chat 13, from ECL6 block 28 (the step script's events are 0-based: 1 the front gate 7,0/8,0,
# 2 the guards outside the quarters 4,0, 3 the quarters 5,0, 4 the climbable wall 14,3 1,7 1,8
# 6,14, 5 the commandant's men 4,1). The riders at 6:25 3,32 (YES) bring the party to the gate;
# stepping on 7,0 starts the escort: the commandant takes the papers, the tour, the quarters
# (5,0). Back on 5,0: RELAX until dinner (WALK AROUND only meets the guards at 4,0). Dinner
# takes three topics (one each; a topic used twice ends it): CITY (OLD: the Tirantikus
# legend, then TROUBLE and DON'T TALK), MAGIC (MENTION POOL OF RADIANCE: journal 46), POLITICS
# (DON'T KNOW). Then the night: SLEEP WITH A WATCH (asleep, the four guards hit first), two
# fights, an alarm (0x4A17: each step may bring more guards, bigger each time). Out by the gate
# (stepping off 7,0/8,0 north) or over the wall (14,3 and the others): 0x4AB4 = 253; back at 3,32 the band makes it 254, which the
# clerk rewards (index 14, "COMPLETED YOUR MISSION SO SWIFTLY", 0x4ABE = 254: Urslingen next).
# ATTACK at 4,0 (0x4A0E) plays the commandant's fights instead; the Clue Book says don't.
# The sweep's exits at 4,0 (ATTACK, then SURRENDER: stripped and thrown out) are left out of
# the lab's exits.txt. No camping inside: a rest before the night goes straight to dinner, after it to the guards.
rest 6:28 inn
answer 6:28 WALK AROUND OR WILL YOU JUST RELAX|RELAX
answer 6:28 WHAT WILL YOU TALK ABOUT|CITY
answer 6:28 NEW OR OLD PHLAN|OLD
answer 6:28 ANY TROUBLE WITH TYRANTHRAXUS|TROUBLE
answer 6:28 HOW STRONG ARE THEY|DON'T TALK
answer 6:28 NEXT TOPIC OF DISSCUSION|MAGIC,POLITICS
answer 6:28 UNIQUE MAGICAL ITEMS OR PLACES|MENTION POOL OF RADIANCE
answer 6:28 ULRICH EBERHARD|DON'T KNOW
answer 6:28 HOW DO YOU SPEND THE NIGHT|SLEEP WITH A WATCH
answer 6:28 RETURN TO THEM NOW|RETURN
answer 6:28 THE WALL IS CLIMBABLE|CLIMB OVER WALL
answer 6:28 SURRENDER OR DIE|ATTACK
