# from his cell once released (5:3; the Clue Book's way: free him for the password). The
# giants asleep: SNEAK OUT QUIETLY. The giants' frogs-and-toads quarrel: LEAVE. The mage who
# begs for his life (5:5): LET HIM GO. The scribe (5:4): tie him up; the overseer's slaves:
# free them. The priests of Bane (5:6): LEAVE. Tyranthraxus (5:7): every member votes ATTACK.
answer 5:3 IN THE NAME OF CHANTUA|RELEASE HIM
answer 5:3 SNEAK OUT QUIETLY|SNEAK OUT QUIETLY
answer 5:4 WHAT DO YOU DO|KILL THE OVERSEER AND FREE THE SLAVES
answer 5:4 SCRIBE COMING TOWARD THE BUILDING|AMBUSH AND TIE HIM UP
answer 5:5 FROGS AND TOADS|LEAVE
answer 5:5 SPARE ME AND I WILL LEAVE|LET HIM GO
answer 5:5 I'LL GIVE YOU ALL MY NOTES|LET HIM GO
answer 5:6 ACCEPT THE BLESSING OF LORD BANE|LEAVE
answer 5:7 HOW DO YOU VOTE|ATTACK
